The '''Coal Mine''' is the [[Location]] within the [[Hub Island]] that introduces the player to {{Skill|Mining}}.

{{ZoneText|Mine &8Coal&f.|Travel to the &6Gold Mine&f.}}

== Purpose ==
The '''Coal Mine''' primarily allows the player to mine for {{Item|Coal}} and {{Item|Stone}}, There are also access points to the {{Zone|Gold Mine}}, {{Zone|Graveyard}}, and {{Zone|Crypts}}.

